WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.950
Welcome to Ear Biscuits,

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:08.280
the podcast where two lifelong
friends talk about life

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.600
for a long time.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.470
I'm Link.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:11.303
And I'm Rhett.

00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:13.440
This week at The Round
Table of Dim Lighting,

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.650
we are catching up with
one another and with you

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.620
about our recent trips that we took.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:24.090
I went to Florida for parents weekend

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:27.030
to visit my freshman
in college son, Locke.

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:30.250
This was your first visit
since you dropped him off-

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.580
Since dropping him off.
... at college.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.413
Yeah.

00:00:33.413 --> 00:00:34.530
So that's a big deal.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.123
That's a milestone moment.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.020
You, Jessie, and Shepherd, you all went.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.670
Yeah, we decided to not
leave our 14 year old alone

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:44.870
and to bring him with us,

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:46.963
which ended up being
an interesting choice.

00:00:46.963 --> 00:00:49.463
I mean, we would've never not done that,

00:00:49.463 --> 00:00:52.422
but I just have a POV on what it's like-

00:00:52.422 --> 00:00:54.240
That normal choice
became very interesting?

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.400
Well, I have a POV on
what it's like to hang out

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:57.603
with a 14 year old-

00:00:58.920 --> 00:00:59.753
I would hope you do

00:00:59.753 --> 00:01:01.440
... that you might find interesting.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:06.140
And you had a little bit more
pleasurable trip, I assume.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.520
Oh yeah, definitely.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:13.380
Christy and I had a getaway to Big Sur.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:15.224
About this time last year, I believe,

00:01:15.224 --> 00:01:16.623
is when we went to Big Sur.

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.800
So I'm not gonna rehash.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.750
There was a decent amount of overlap.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.430
Last time, there was a lot of rain

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:27.813
on the tin roof of the cabin,
none of that this time.

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:31.680
But still a bunch of beautiful trees.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:35.043
But there were a couple
of things that happened,

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:40.020
a person that I met that
I could not have predicted

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:42.480
that I would meet deep in the forest.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.560
Okay.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.603
And an encounter,

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:52.150
an intimate encounter
unlike any I've ever had

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:56.823
that did not really involve Christy.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.693
Oh my.
How's that for a teaser?

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.103
I'm excited.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.210
You actually look kind of
tired, you don't look excited.

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:07.043
Well, I am tired.

00:02:07.043 --> 00:02:09.180
I mean, that's the thing.

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:10.593
We work hard, man.

00:02:12.713 --> 00:02:15.750
I saw a few comments, I
can't remember where it was.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.427
I tend to not read comments

00:02:17.427 --> 00:02:19.713
and I find out why whenever I do.

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:24.750
But back when you took a vacation
and then I took a vacation

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.570
and we talked about them on Ear Biscuits

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:31.740
and because we are YouTubers

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:33.840
and because we like to be sensational

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:38.340
about the way we title things
and the way we describe things

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.083
because it's called entertainment,

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:44.100
we called it Worst Vacation Ever, right?

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.220
And then there were a
few people who are like,

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:49.470
I don't want to hear two rich guys

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:54.033
complain about their vacation
