00:26:02.910 --> 00:26:04.470
She gets real car sick.

00:26:04.470 --> 00:26:06.690
So it's like driving should help.

00:26:06.690 --> 00:26:07.860
Right.

00:26:07.860 --> 00:26:11.040
I pullover on the side of the road,

00:26:11.040 --> 00:26:12.690
basically in the middle of nowhere,

00:26:12.690 --> 00:26:14.940
we were about to lose cell service.

00:26:14.940 --> 00:26:18.460
Again, thank goodness I
pulled over where we did

00:26:19.620 --> 00:26:23.580
