00:27:48.210 --> 00:27:49.140
Go ahead and call AAA."

00:27:49.140 --> 00:27:50.610
I'm like, "I'm just
gonna sit here and think,

00:27:50.610 --> 00:27:53.490
I need to think for a second
and need gather my thoughts."

00:27:53.490 --> 00:27:55.740
She's like, "Well you can
call AAA and then think.

00:27:55.740 --> 00:27:57.750
And so that way we're waiting even less."

00:27:57.750 --> 00:27:59.760
And like she's making
good points at this point.

00:27:59.760 --> 00:28:00.690
And she's like,

00:28:00.690 --> 00:28:04.177
but then I ended up doing
this thing where she was like,

00:28:04.177 --> 00:28:06.930
"Just, well, I'm trying to help."

00:28:06.930 --> 00:28:08.910
And I'm like, "I'm trying to help.

00:28:08.910 --> 00:28:10.591
I'm trying to help."

00:28:10.591 --> 00:28:13.830
This is how toddler I got.

00:28:13.830 --> 00:28:17.700
I was just so, it was
just like feeling like

00:28:17.700 --> 00:28:19.920
this is ruining our trip,

00:28:19.920 --> 00:28:22.260
I am totally inadequate to fix this.

00:28:22.260 --> 00:28:24.780
I just felt, I don't
know, it was just like,

00:28:24.780 --> 00:28:27.150
I felt like I was really in my head

00:28:27.150 --> 00:28:30.120
