You told her that you were joking.

00:28:45.840 --> 00:28:47.160
That I was halfway joking.

00:28:47.160 --> 00:28:50.730
'Cause I was, I was like,
" don't know what to do."

00:28:50.730 --> 00:28:52.620
It's like I was yelling
